  "title": [
    "[Maelstrom Bay, Bottom]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "A pair of tall elkhorn corals stand in the sand of the bay floor like sentinels.  Bluish turtle grass, thick as a lawn, surrounds the coral.  A few grey, egg-sized stones lay scattered in the turtle grass.  Dozens of yellow-striped fish, no bigger than a dwarf's thumb, meander through the thick grasses."
